                            <comment id="15244487" author="rdblue" created="Sun, 17 Apr 2016 00:28:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for fixing this, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pnarang&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pnarang&quot;&gt;pnarang&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;About scaling the size of the array up from a smaller size, I think &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexlevenson&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexlevenson&quot;&gt;alexlevenson&lt;/a&gt; may be able to comment about why this was 64k to begin with. I&apos;ve not done extensive testing but I definitely recommend talking with him if you&apos;d like to change the way that works. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857543" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:28:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1961&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1961&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
